\pard\ql\par
\b\fs24\cf2 Existing Bottlenecks:\par
\b0\fs21\cf0 1. \b Fragile:\b0  Unhandled syntax typos cause instant crashes.\par
2. \b Passive:\b0  Single prompt without self-verification or error recovery.\par
3. \b Diagnostic only:\b0  Flags inefficient loops but cannot rewrite or fix the code.\par
4. \b Static UI:\b0  The dependency graph is a flat image without interactive movement.\par
\par
