\pard\par
\b\fs24\cf2 Meet the 5 Specialized AI Agents:\par
\b0\fs20\cf0\par
\b Agent 0: The Self-Healing Agent (Error Recovery Specialist)\b0\par
Analogy: An automatic spell-checker in Microsoft Word that instantly fixes typos.\par
Job: If a user forgets a colon or has bad indentation, this agent diagnoses the line, patches the code autonomously, and alerts the user.\par
\par
\b Agent 1: The Structural Inspector (AST & PDG Detective)\b0\par
Analogy: A building architect examining the structural blueprint before renovation.\par
Job: Extracts the AST tree and builds a complete map of control and data dependencies (who passes what to whom).\par
\par
\b Agent 2: The Green Computing Auditor (Energy Inspector)\b0\par
Analogy: An Energy Star appliance inspector checking power consumption.\par
